{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6d4d67d6ff7b8d1e2786ffa1c23cbed8fe866091b8291aba8d722887369069a", "ja": "（今日は天体公演『ルナ』のリハーサルだ。\n真が着替えるなりどこかに出て行ったが……）", "zh": "（今天是天体公演《Luna》的彩排。真刚换完衣服就出去了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5bbdc090e0b4af58ead0a983afad58be2806e4f0799f5b5b7c8191e1ad2398d2", "ja": "（ああ、あんな所にいた）", "zh": "（啊，原来在那儿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd5bfccf9b10c9b0d2f6e8f61344e710aed37af15712362466256e9050f2afd2", "ja": "真、リハの開始はまだ時間あるけど……\n客席で何してるんだ？", "zh": "真，距离彩排开始还有一段时间呢……\n你在观众席做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "6ec23a9950bd600e2bdcd9304486cb65b35ae7740b7c500e80c0fa1916e52c17", "ja": "{$P$}。\n客席からステージがどう見えるのか、見てたんです。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我在看从观众席看舞台是什么样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "33f201bea6fee961aac729ef4085ea783798e03d41542e289678a57b0084725a", "ja": "うん、やっぱり少し遠いですね。", "zh": "嗯，果然还是有点远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1005_p", "source_sha256": "45b76213ecfe0f236c329ddf70decd036c18c943fa0e6c7ec77f1ef3577512d3", "ja": "まあ、この辺が一番後ろだし。\nこうしてみると、少し距離があるよな。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟这边已经是最后面了。\n这么一看，确实有点距离。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "b1cf0c109d40b7a8c93d355335a7f9390587e9bfced8d9e66a4fcf433c156196", "ja": "でも、ここにいる人達にも、\nボク達『ルナ』の光を届けなくちゃ……。", "zh": "不过，也得把我们“Luna”的光芒传递给站在这里的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "1cf12dee0cad1dbd04829224209f8960f6425ec6cb1085697e0323608a79b379", "ja": "なんて、ちょっと思ったんですよね！　ほら、この\n公演って、いろんな公演と繋がってるじゃないですか。", "zh": "我刚才稍微这么想了一下！你看，这场\n公演不是和各种各样的公演都有联系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "a653aec3000400dc95587eda221458f9c4802ce6c545211fb525d5d49f1e550a", "ja": "『ソル』、それに『BlueMoon Harmony』。\nそして『STARDOM ROAD』。", "zh": "『ソル』，还有『BlueMoon Harmony』。\n以及『STARDOM ROAD』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "7dbb2799337e7176cc86d5da9df33a7c793957c60e7d74e7ebf6a286aaba1a83", "ja": "そういう全部を隅々まで、しっかり照らし出すために。\nそれが『ルナ』の役目、ですよね？", "zh": "为了把这一切的每个角落都彻底照亮。那就是『Luna』的职责，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b0da8d18b3965ba71a584df9bb175eeb0eb5945848330ce8823b18091209a90d", "ja": "……ああ。チケットは完売、本番はここまでお客さんで\nいっぱいだ。みんなが真達を見に来る。", "zh": "……啊。票已经全部卖光了，演出现场从这里到最后一排都坐满了观众。大家都是来看真她们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1011_p", "source_sha256": "19d329e8af8f1a871c73a4e931da1330937eb931974be8d94bae3bcf8f424751", "ja": "その、最後列のひとりまで、輝きで照らすのが\n『ルナ』だ。頼んだぞ。", "zh": "就连最后一排的每一个人，都要用光芒照亮——这就是『ルナ』。拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "5ddfa711f18a197a4063cf2c08393fb5a5ace9bb1c042857acb941f3afb30436", "ja": "ええ、やってやりますよ！　気合い十分です。\n必ずあのステージから、ここまで……", "zh": "好，我会做到的！干劲十足。\n一定要从那个舞台上，照耀到这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "a87bf4078646a72381ea25f4248c3efe5370832d92ff439a49a1f9d7f7d775cd", "ja": "……あっ。向こう、響が手を振ってる。", "zh": "……啊。那边，响正在挥手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6dc101035ffaaa9ce0c17f6b6e582de9e1515eba7f6a850effc95ed9d6d7931d", "ja": "もうすぐリハが始まるな。戻ろうか、真。", "zh": "排练马上就要开始了。回去吧，真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "516ce90d39dfcc856fef2ebfd34d11535892b4d004401143a4617981a12b2cb2", "ja": "はい。\n……でも。悔しいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯。\n……可是，真不甘心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1016_p", "source_sha256": "27df8fb9c2a8683b1a6a065e62a2620e650619c40eaa09c32f6ee2b1ead1b0ba", "ja": "うん？　何がだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "b63b40694a2444d0c5ac78ce9d56949e941a38b551d77065b30dd6ee3a3c1444", "ja": "響ですよ。こんなに離れてるのに、\nすぐにあそこにいるってわかりました。", "zh": "是响哦。明明离得这么远，我却马上就知道她在那里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "dea859127a846e8c3f9c41155c52685e971f40807c29ab997082ab91c2586501", "ja": "それだけ目立つんですよね、響って。\nまさに『ルナ』じゃないですか。", "zh": "响就是这么显眼啊。\n简直就是“露娜”嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1019_p", "source_sha256": "aeff604a6c417120120466b4227d9380e614d9f62509e899d9236f93a7a6056e", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ、真もまさに\n『ルナ』だから大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "原来如此……。那么，真也是正如其名的“露娜”，所以没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "737f0865233fa67adbda331e479496e5809bdd9a0728710e15165cda456c4316", "ja": "えっ？　どうしてです？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1021_p", "source_sha256": "58699c1aa4aaf54d68628782f56eb041569753f332193986becc9270216a2db8", "ja": "おっと、リハが始まるから本当に急がないと。\nほら、急いで急いで！", "zh": "糟糕，彩排要开始了，真的得赶紧走了。\n快，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "73c24495c4416c5f4c35a9641340929574dd9b9d6ec6270e03e5a2a640f47f59", "ja": "ええっ、行きますけど～！\n教えてくれたっていいじゃないですかぁ！", "zh": "诶，我会去的嘛～！\n告诉我一下也没关系吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5e50b7ffbc95ee391735f32322253be711259b0ed34a8bdf1151e2563a49e891", "ja": "帰りながら話すって。まず、俺がどうして\n真がここにいると分かったか、という所からな。", "zh": "边走边说吧。先从我为什么\n会知道真在这里说起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0383_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "877ab3b351723012bde0254603ab81ac4172262cffe439f69b0141bbae60b955", "ja": "え？　それは……、ん？\n……あ……、へへっ、なるほどです！", "zh": "咦？那是……嗯？\n……啊……嘿嘿，原来如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
